  "note": "Official Pokemon artwork (Ken Sugimori style, 475x475 RGBA PNG, anti-aliased, transparent background), same repository and commit as the in-game sprite folders. Used only by the 绘卷 (painted) theme for large portraits (unit panel, lineup picker, battle cards); map tokens keep the pixel sprites. Downscaled here to 192x192 (the 84 CSS px unit portrait at DPR 2 plus headroom) with Chromium canvas high-quality resampling in two steps (475 -> 238 -> 192) and stored as WebP quality 0.88 to keep the folder near 1 MB; sourceSha256 / sourceBytes identify the downloaded PNG. One file per species in src/browser/sprites.ts POKEDEX (docs/design/fidelity/README.md).",
